Package: dsDarwinHelpers
Title: Shared DataSHIELD Server Helpers for dsDarwin Packages
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("dsDarwin", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "karectl@lthtr.nhs.uk")
Description: Server-side helpers shared by the dsDarwin server packages that
    wrap DARWIN EU functions: disclosure control with the server's DataSHIELD
    thresholds and argument checks. Declares no DataSHIELD methods itself.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
